# Linux release notes policy

Until explicitly told otherwise, treat this repository as Linux-first for public release instructions.

## Required for every Linux release

- Include clear Linux install instructions directly in the GitHub release body.
- Tell users to use the release asset zip (`atak-imagery-vX.Y.Z-linux-install.zip`), not the GitHub source zip.
- Include runnable terminal commands for install from the release zip.
- Keep launcher names consistent: `ATAK Device Installer` and `ATAK Imagery Downloader`.

## Do not include

- Windows install steps, Windows packaging guidance, or Windows-only caveats in Linux release instructions.
- Any wording that implies a Windows installer is part of the current Linux release cycle.

## Override rule

Only include Windows release instructions when the user explicitly asks to publish/support Windows builds.
